    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t_physics",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 95,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "颜色物理\n\n观察色 = 光源色 × 物体反射色\n(逐分量相乘)\n\n例：白光(1,1,1)×珊瑚色(1,0.5,0.31)\n= (1.0, 0.5, 0.31)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "box_physics",
      "originalText": "颜色物理\n\n观察色 = 光源色 × 物体反射色\n(逐分量相乘)\n\n例：白光(1,1,1)×珊瑚色(1,0.5,0.31)\n= (1.0, 0.5, 0.31)",
      "autoResize": true,
