    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t_scene",
      "x": 380,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 70,
      "text": "场景结构：一个 VBO 几何 + 两个 VAO + 两套 Shader\n\n被照射物体(大) ← lightingShader → lightColor × objectColor\n光源立方体(小) ← lightCubeShader → 纯白 vec4(1.0)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "box_scene",
      "originalText": "场景结构：一个 VBO 几何 + 两个 VAO + 两套 Shader\n\n被照射物体(大) ← lightingShader → lightColor × objectColor\n光源立方体(小) ← lightCubeShader → 纯白 vec4(1.0)",
      "autoResize": true,
