    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t_vbo",
      "x": 380,
      "y": 210,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "共享 VBO 的多 VAO 写法\n\nglGenBuffers(1, &VBO) → 一次上传顶点\nglGenVertexArrays(1, &cubeVAO) → 记录 cube 属性\nglGenVertexArrays(1, &lightVAO) → 记录 light 属性\n\n优点：显存只存一份几何，切换 VAO 即切换渲染配置",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "box_vbo",
      "originalText": "共享 VBO 的多 VAO 写法\n\nglGenBuffers(1, &VBO) → 一次上传顶点\nglGenVertexArrays(1, &cubeVAO) → 记录 cube 属性\nglGenVertexArrays(1, &lightVAO) → 记录 light 属性\n\n优点：显存只存一份几何，切换 VAO 即切换渲染配置",
      "autoResize": true,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1691130328,
